---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { jurisdiction, office } from "../office";
import { href } from "../paths";

const LAW = "https://legis.la.gov/Legis/Law.aspx?d=";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description={`${office.justice}, ${office.title}, ${office.ward}, ${jurisdiction}, and what a justice of the peace does.`}
>
  <h1>{office.justice}</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    {office.title}, {office.ward}, {jurisdiction}
  </p>
  <div class="portrait">
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt={`${office.justice}, ${office.title}, ${office.ward}`}
      widths={[176, 352, 528]}
      sizes="(max-width: 30rem) 14rem, 11rem"
    />
    <div>
      {office.biography.map((paragraph) => (
        <p>{paragraph}</p>
      ))}
      <p>First elected: {office.year_elected}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2>What is a justice of the peace?</h2>
  <p>
    A justice of the peace is a judge elected by the voters of a ward. The term
    is six years. The justice must live in the ward.{" "}
    <a href={`${LAW}77366`}>R.S. 13:2582</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    The court is meant to be simple and near at hand. You may state your case in
    your own words, the hearing is informal, and the judge's duty is to find the
    facts and reach a fair decision.{" "}
    <a href={`${LAW}112124`}>C.C.P. art. 4917</a>;{" "}
    <a href={`${LAW}962202`}>art. 4921.2</a>.
  </p>
  <p>A justice of the peace:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      decides <a href={href("/small-claims/")}>civil claims</a> of $5,000 or
      less. <a href={`${LAW}112118`}>C.C.P. art. 4911</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      decides <a href={href("/evictions/")}>evictions</a>.{" "}
      <a href={`${LAW}112119`}>C.C.P. art. 4912</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      performs <a href={href("/weddings/")}>marriage ceremonies</a>.{" "}
      <a href={`${LAW}106877`}>R.S. 9:202</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      acts as a <a href={href("/notary/")}>notary</a> with limited powers.{" "}
      <a href={`${LAW}77373`}>R.S. 13:2586.1</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      serves as a committing magistrate for the parish, with power to set bail
      in cases that are not capital or necessarily punishable at hard labor, and
      to require peace bonds. <a href={`${LAW}77372`}>R.S. 13:2586</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>The constable</h2>
  <p>
    Each justice of the peace court has one constable, elected by the same
    voters for the same six-year term. <a href={`${LAW}77367`}>R.S. 13:2583</a>.
    The constable serves the court's papers and enforces its judgments.{" "}
    <a href={`${LAW}77372`}>R.S. 13:2586</a>. The Ward 10 constable is{" "}
    {office.constable}.
  </p>
  <h2>Ward 10</h2>
  <p>{office.territory}</p>
  <p>
    Not sure whether you live in Ward 10?{" "}
    <a href={href("/contact/")}>Contact the office</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
